sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\">Arboricultural</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW106817611 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Method Statement and Tree Protection Plan</span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW106817611 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To protect\r\nand safeguard the existing retained trees in accordance with the following\r\nDevelopment Plan policies for Merton: policy G7 of the London Plan 2021 and policies\r\nO15.1, O15.2 and O15.4 of the Local Plan 2024.&nbsp;</span></span><o:p></o:p></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Surface Treatment</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - No development shall take place until details of the\r\nsurfacing of all those parts of the site not covered by buildings or soft\r\nlandscaping, including any parking, service areas or roads, footpaths, hard and\r\nsoft have been submitted in writing for approval by the Local Planning\r\nAuthority. No works that are the subject of this condition shall be carried out\r\nuntil the details are approved, and the development shall not be occupied / the\r\nuse of the development hereby approved shall not commence until the details\r\nhave been approved and works to which this condition relates have been carried\r\nout in accordance with the approved details.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nstandard of development in accordance with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policy D4 of the London Plan 2021 and policies D12.1 and\r\nD12.3 of the Local Plan 2024 </span></span></span></p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\">Tree Protection: The details and measures for the protection of the existing trees as specified in the hereby approved document ‘</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\">Arboricultural</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Impact Assessment Method Statement &amp;amp; Tree Protection Plan (to BS:5837 2012)’ reference 'TH5953B' and dated ’2nd April 2026' shall be fully complied with. The methods for the protection of the existing trees shall fully</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\">accord</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">with</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyIj48ZyBmaWxsPSJub25lIiBmaWxsLXJ1bGU9ImV2ZW5vZGQiPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoMTB2MkgweiIvPjxwYXRoIHN0cm9rZT0iIzcxNjBFOCIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjIiIGQ9Ik0xIDFoNCIvPjwvZz48L3N2Zz4=&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\">all of</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148584789 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the measures specified in the report and shall be installed prior to the commencement of any site works and shall remain in place until the conclusion of all site works.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">To protect\r\nand safeguard the existing retained trees in accordance with the following\r\nDevelopment Plan policies for Merton: policy G7 of the London Plan 2021 and policies\r\nO15.1, O15.2 and O15.4 of the Local Plan 2024.</span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Obscured Glazing</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - Before the development hereby permitted is first\r\noccupied, the windows in the NE elevation at 1st floor level shall be glazed with obscured glass and non opening below an internal height of 1.7m and shall be maintained as such thereafter.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 &amp; D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024.&nbsp;</span></span></p>"
